  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:joke_bandit_9#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 183,
      "string_id": "joke_bandit_9",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "A horde of fleshes keeps running in circles. Suddenly the leader stops and says: \"So, brethren... Have we made GREAT noise?\"\n\\n\"Yes, we have!\"\n\\n\"Have we raised TONNES of dust in the air?\"\n\\n\"Yes, yes, we have!!!\"\n\\n\"We are almost like HORSES, then!\"\n        ",
      "JA_current": "フレッシュの群れがぐるぐる走り回ってた。するとリーダーが立ち止まって言った。「兄弟たち……でっけえ音を立てたか？」\n\\n「立てたぞ！」\n\\n「ものすごい砂ぼこりを巻き上げたか？」\n\\n「そうとも、巻き上げた！」\n\\n「じゃあ俺たち、ほとんど馬みたいなもんだな！」\n         ",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:dialog_bandit_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 585,
      "string_id": "dialog_bandit_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "It's not clothes that make the man, out here it is only the man that makes the difference, his clothes be damned. The Zone ain't a bar with a backroom brothel and cheap whores, nor is it a kindergarten. See what I'm getting at here? Ya can get yourself some pro gear and a cool shooter, have money to burn and swim in artifacts, but if yer head is full of shit and you get caught with your hands in your pockets, you'll get wasted just like that! No second chances for ya, one mistake is all you get! I'm telling ya, be attentive! Pay attention! Eyes peeled at all times! Otherwise, you'll end up just like Vitka Nosy. I told him hundreds o'times, \"Don't walk by these gaps, don't go over there!\" He wouldn't listen! Now we can't even find his body. \\nJust got a message on the PDA - \"Stalker died: Vitka Nosy. Cause of death: unknown...\"\n        ",
      "JA_current": "人間を作るのは服じゃない。ここじゃ大事なのは中身だけだ、身なりなんざどうでもいい。ゾーンは裏に売春宿がついた安酒場でもなけりゃ、幼稚園でもないんだ。言いたいこと、分かるか？ どんなプロ仕様の装備やイカした銃を持っていようが、金が腐るほどあってアーティファクトで泳いでいようが、頭ん中がクソ塗れでポケットに手を突っ込んでボケッとしてたら、あっさりくたばるだけだ！ 二度目のチャンスなんかない、失敗は一度きりだ！ だから言ってるだろ、気を引き締めろ！ 周りに注意を払え！ いつだって目を光らせておけ！ そうしないと、ヴィトカ・ノージーの二の舞になるぞ。あいつには何百回も言ってやったんだ、「あの隙間のそばを通るな、あっちへ行くな！」ってな。なのに聞く耳を持ちやがらなかった！ 今じゃ死体すら見つかりゃしない。 \\nPDAに通知が来やがったよ――「ストーカー死亡：ヴィトカ・ノージー。死因：不明……」\n         ",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:trader_relation_stalker_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 633,
      "string_id": "trader_relation_stalker_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yeah, you've managed to piss off quite a few of the stalkers around here, better fix your act now or they'll get together and put you out of your misery while you sleep. I won't always be around to cover for you and it's a ruthless world out there, the stalkers have a way of cleaning out the bad apples, know what I mean? Remember, Marked One, that trust and reputation are often the only things a stalker can rely on to survive in the Zone and you're throwing both away... Now then, I'll try to salvage your reputation, but you'll have to earn back their trust. Give me 20 grand and you can sleep peacefully tonight, as all your sins are washed away, he-he-he...",
      "JA_current": "ああ、あんた、この辺のストーカーをだいぶ怒らせてくれたようだな。今のうちに態度を改めねえと、連中が結託して、寝込みを襲って楽にしてくれるぞ。俺がいつでもかばってやれると思うなよ。ここは容赦のない世界だ。腐ったリンゴを間引くのがストーカー流ってもんさ。分かるだろ？ いいか、マークド・ワン。ゾーンで生き延びるのに頼れるのは、いつだって信頼と評判だけだ。あんたはその両方をドブに捨ててるんだぞ……まあいい、俺があんたの評判を立て直してやる。だが、信頼を取り戻すのはあんた自身だ。2万ルーブル出せば、今夜は安心して眠れるようにしてやるよ。罪もきれいさっぱり洗い流してな、へへへ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:trader_relation_stalker_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 641,
      "string_id": "trader_relation_stalker_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Ah, in walks the devil himself. Marked One, I did not save you from that Death Truck and nurture you back to health only for you to turn feral and eliminate all my potential customers! I don't know what kind of problems you have with the loners but I suggest you put it aside because you're seriously pissing all over my business here! Ok, you want me to fix things up? You'll have to pay up! For all the losses you've cost me, you'll have to hand over 40k and I'll try to put things right, no guarantees though. Now, get out of here and lay low until I fix your mess.",
      "JA_current": "おやおや、悪魔のお出ましか。マークド・ワン、死のトラックから助け出して、わざわざ健康な体に戻してやったのはな、あんたが野獣になって俺の上客どもを皆殺しにするためじゃないぞ！ ローナー連中と何の揉め事があるか知らんが、いい加減にしておけ。俺の商売を台無しにする気か！ ……分かったよ、仲裁してほしいんだろ？ なら相応の金を払ってもらおうか！ あんたのせいで被った損失の穴埋めに、4万ルーブルきっちり出してもらおう。何とか話をまとめてやるが、保証はできんぞ。さあ、とっとと出ていって、俺が片をつけるまで身を潜めてろ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:trader_relation_stalker_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 649,
      "string_id": "trader_relation_stalker_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Look who it is, in walks Hitler's incarnate, the Zone's own fucking death machine! How many stalkers have you wasted so far today, you stupid psychopath? I should have you put down like a rabid dog, give me one good reason why I should let you leave this bunker alive?? Killing you would be so good for business, all the stalkers around would party all night, and I'd get to sell a shit ton of booze. After all your mess, you think you get to just walk in here and ask me to put things right?! How exactly do you expect me to do that?? Only solution I see is to put a bullet in your skull! Fuck, I need a drink... Okay, Marked One, you reached out, you came to me, I respect that you had guts to walk right into the camp here to talk peace. I'll throw you a bone and give you a chance to pay me back for the hardships you caused to my establishment. Hand over 60 thousand rubles, and I'll work on trying to make this carnage look like somebody else's work, a stolen PDA, some type of merc frame job, whatever... Give me time to think, meanwhile go hide yourself and don't show your face back here for a while!",
      "JA_current": "誰かと思えば、ヒトラーの生まれ変わり、ゾーン謹製の殺人マシーン様のお出ましじゃないか！ 今日だけで何人のストーカーを血祭りにあげたんだ、この頭のイカれたサイコ野郎が？ 狂犬みたいに射殺してやりたいところだが、あんたをこのバンカーから生きて帰す理由が一つでもあるか！？ あんたをブチ殺せば商売は大繁盛、界隈のストーカーどもは朝まで大宴会で、俺は酒を浴びるほど売りさばけるんだぞ。散々引っかき回しておいて、のこのこやって来て仲裁してくれだと！？ いったいどうやって収めろってんだ！？ 俺に思いつく解決策は、あんたの頭蓋骨に弾丸をブチ込むことくらいだ！ クソッ、酒でも飲まなきゃやってられん……分かったよ、マークド・ワン。あんたのほうから接触してきたんだ、わざわざこのキャンプに乗り込んで手打ちを頼みに来るその度胸だけは認めてやる。情けをかけてやるよ、俺の店に与えた損害の埋め合わせをするチャンスをやろう。6万ルーブル置いていけ。盗まれたPDAだの、マーセナリーズの仕業だのに見せかけて、この大虐殺を誰か別の奴のせいにでっち上げてやる……考える時間をくれ。それまでどこかに隠れて、しばらく顔を見せるな！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:trader_relation_stalker_9#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 657,
      "string_id": "trader_relation_stalker_9",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Ok. Here's hoping the loners take it easy from now on.",
      "JA_current": "分かった。これでローナーどもが大人しくなってくれるといいが。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:trader_relation_stalker_12#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 668,
      "string_id": "trader_relation_stalker_12",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Alright. Less fighting means less trouble.",
      "JA_current": "よし。争いが減れば、それだけ厄介事も減る。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1234,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Got a job for you, Marked One... I want you to find a stalker called Nimble, he was carrying some very important information. He disappeared somewhere near the bridge. Find him, dead or alive - I don't care, I need the flash drive with the info. Visit Wolf from the local camp, and ask him. He certainly knows where that guy can be.",
      "JA_current": "仕事があるぞ、マークド・ワン……ニンブルというストーカーを探してほしい。極めて重要な情報を持っていたんだが、鉄道橋のあたりで行方不明になった。生死は問わん、とにかく情報の入ったフラッシュドライブが必要なんだ。近くのキャンプにいるウルフに話を聞いてみろ。あいつなら、ニンブルの居場所に心当たりがあるはずだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_1111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1237,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_1111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Is that it?",
      "JA_current": "それだけか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_199#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1255,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_199",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Wait. Here, take this pistol and ammo. You won't last two seconds in the Zone without a weapon! By the way, when you were brought here, you had a knife. I took it off you just in case your head wasn't quite working. You look OK though, so here it is.",
      "JA_current": "待て。ほら、このピストルと弾を持っていけ。武器もなしじゃ、ゾーンじゃ二秒と生き残れんぞ！ そういえば、ここに担ぎ込まれたとき、ナイフを持っていたな。頭がまともに働いていないと危ないから預かっておいたんだが、もう大丈夫そうだな。ほら、返してやるよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_1999#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1258,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_1999",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Thank you.",
      "JA_current": "ありがとう。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_51#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1294,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_51",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Task complete. Here's the artifact.",
      "JA_current": "仕事を片づけてきた。アーティファクトはこれだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_511#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1297,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_511",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Great, Marked One. One more little favor and we're even.",
      "JA_current": "見事だ、マークド・ワン。あと一つだけ小さな頼みを聞いてくれれば、これで貸し借りなしだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_5111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1300,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_5111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What favor?",
      "JA_current": "頼みって何だ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
