    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_trader_start_dialog_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1339,
      "string_id": "escape_trader_start_dialog_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Marked One, I've told you everything already. Get outta here!",
      "JA_current": "マークド・ワン、もう話すことは全部話したぞ。さっさと出ていけ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:tutorial_wounded_give_medkit_21111111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1546,
      "string_id": "tutorial_wounded_give_medkit_21111111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I see... Well, I'll give you a piece of advice then. Free of charge, but not free of sense. What is the most important thing in the Zone? It's not money, it's information! Keeps you away from trouble, and points you towards loot. You got a PDA yet? Every stalker uses a PDA, you can receive, send and store information just like that. Quite often stalkers will share tips, advice and suggestions for finding loot on the global chat. Someone will see an untouched body somewhere and share location, there's an opportunity for you to search for a stash right there. \\n \\nOf course, shit happens out here all the time, and you'll run into dead stalkers. Pick up their PDA and download info from it, some people will even buy PDAs off you for a decent price, depends on who owned it. Data transfer is very simple and every PDA contains a decoder so you can simply just press a button and transfer info onto your PDA. This includes map markers indicating stashes hidden around the Zone. All sorts of goodies within them.",
      "JA_current": "そうか……なら、一ついいアドバイスをしてやるよ。タダだが、役に立つ知恵だ。ゾーンで一番大事なものは何だと思う？ 金じゃない、情報だ！ 情報があれば危険を避けられるし、獲物のありかも分かる。もうPDAは持ってるか？ ストーカーなら誰でも使ってる。情報を受信したり送信したり、保存したりできるんだ。全体チャットで獲物のありかのヒントや助言を共有してくれる奴も多い。誰かが手つかずの死体を見つけて位置を流せば、そこがお宝を探す絶好のチャンスになるってわけだ。\\n \\nもちろん、ここじゃ日常茶飯事で人が死ぬから、くたばったストーカーに出くわすこともある。そいつらのPDAを拾ってデータを吸い出すんだ。持ち主次第じゃ、PDAをいい値で買い取ってくれる奴もいるぞ。データ転送は至って簡単で、どのPDAにもデコーダーが入ってるから、ボタン一つで自分のPDAに情報を移せる。ゾーンのあちこちに隠されたスタッシュを示すマップマーカーも手に入るぞ。中にはお宝がぎっしり詰まってるのさ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
