      "string_id": "escape_trader_car_trade_111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I can arrange to have a little rust bucket \"Goatling\" delivered to the car park for you. It's seen some use, but it's still got 4 wheels and for only 9000 rubles! I need the cash up front, no refunds!\\n \\n\n\t\tOr if that's too risky for you, feel free to take that ZAPOR by the last house... If you manage to start it, he-he!..",
      "JA_current": "「ゴートリング」のポンコツなら、駐車場まで届くよう手配してやれるぞ。使い古しだがちゃんとタイヤは4つ付いてる、たったの9,000ルーブルだ！ 代金は前払い、返金は受けつけんぞ！\\n \\n\n\t\tそれが怖けりゃ、一番奥の家のそばにあるザポロージェツを勝手に持っていけ……エンジンがかかればの話だがな、へへっ！..",
